sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant P as Page script
participant C as Content script
participant A as API /get_feed
participant R as RedditProcessor
participant L as LLMProcessor
participant O as OpenAI
P->>P: capture feed response
P->>C: SaveBatch event
C->>A: POST /get_feed
A->>R: work_on_feed()
Note over R,L: active filters loaded from filters.db
loop each post, in parallel
  R->>L: evaluate_content()
  L->>O: filter evaluation prompt
  O-->>L: matched filters
  alt filter matched
    R->>L: process_content()
    L->>O: select_text_intervention
    O-->>L: choice 1, 2 or 3
    L->>O: generate transformed text
    O-->>L: marker-wrapped text
    L-->>R: text with markers
  else no match
    Note over R,L: post left unchanged
  end
  Note over R,L: processing_logs row written
end
R-->>A: modified feed HTML
A-->>C: 200 feed.response
C->>P: CustomFeedReady
Note over P,C: DomProcessor renders the markers as blur, warning overlay or rewritten text
